0..77 Comment "// A model does not reach a function through its theory\'s value, nor an inert"
78..113 Comment "// field outside the manifest step."
114..116 Comment "//"
117..195 Comment "// A generic encoder over a module needs the type of a model from the value of"
196..250 Comment "// its theory. It also reads every field of the model."
251..253 Comment "//"
254..330 Comment "// `Model` reads the name of a theory, so a `Theory` variable names no model"
331..395 Comment "// type. Only the manifest step reads an inert field of a model."
